"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":5833832,"digest":"sha256:eb3aa3f4c1c5d39baaa4a443791d511e2dc43c7a497f73abc30ee205803fb538","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-08-26T21:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T21:45:08Z"}],"body":"## Changelog\n* : Add NewBuild for rootCmd.Version (@mrusme)\n* : Add SID validation handling (@mrusme)\n* : Add block fix command (@mrusme)\n* : Add default case for argparser (@mrusme)\n* : Add error handling (@mrusme)\n* : Add importer format error handling (@mrusme)\n* : Add week padding (@mrusme)\n* : Clean up argsparser, add errs (@mrusme)\n* : Fix \"last quarter\", change from UTC to local, fix periodRegex, argparser (@mrusme)\n* : Fix --color shadowing, rename to --display-color (@mrusme)\n* : Fix DestroyRow (@mrusme)\n* : Fix SID DisplayName, fix FitDisplayName for UTF (@mrusme)\n* : Fix command names for argsparser.PDP (@mrusme)\n* : Fix config loading (@mrusme)\n* : Fix db.engine.Close() (@mrusme)\n* : Fix endless loop bug (@mrusme)\n* : Fix error output, direct to stderr (@mrusme)\n* : Fix export output, fix JSON, adjust durations (ms -> s), is_running (@mrusme)\n* : Fix import end (@mrusme)\n* : Fix overlapping block inclusion, add proper clipping (@mrusme)\n* : Fix spelling mistake (@mrusme)\n* : Fix task command, add project SID handling (@mrusme)\n* : Fix timestamp period match (@mrusme)\n* : Fix unbounded timeframes, `zeit block <key>`, `zeit end` on running p/t (@mrusme)\n* : Fix version output (@mrusme)\n* : Optimize project/task queries (@mrusme)\n* : Optimize validator init (@mrusme)\n* : Refactor stats aggregation, timestamp helper (@mrusme)\n* : Refactor/fix v1 importer (@mrusme)\n* : Remove key json tag (@mrusme)\n* : Remove runtime from version command (@mrusme)\n* : Remove unused errstr (@mrusme)\n* : Replace Index with HasPrefix for keys (@mrusme)\n* : Update README.md (@mrusme)\n* : Update dependencies (@mrusme)\n* : Update shield (@mrusme)\n\n","mentions_count":1}
